  "subject": "A mee-sua noodle maker measures every bundle by his own outstretched arms until his new wife, whose arms are shorter, makes shorter bundles, and the customers start queuing for hers because the short strands cook faster.",
  "caption": "1970s Taiwanese Hokkien dance-hall twist pop. Punchy trumpet and trombone riffs answering the vocal, clean chicken-scratch rhythm guitar, round electric bass walking in eighths, tight drum kit with tambourine on every offbeat. Warm 1970s studio recording with tape saturation. Male vocal, bright mid-high register, cheerful playful delivery, clearly sung melody. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 112 BPM, G major. Cheerful, teasing, danceable mood. No synth pads, no distorted guitar, no electronic drums, no autotune, no rap.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n透早三點拉麵線，掛上竹棚頂\n我量麵線免用尺，兩手展開就著\n一把一把仝長，客人攏稱讚\n自從阮某嫁入門，代誌就變款\n[Pre-Chorus]\n伊的手較短，伊的手較短\n伊拉的麵線，嘛較短\n[Chorus]\n手尺麵線，一把賣二十\n伊的手短短，麵線嘛短短\n客人排隊，專買伊彼把\n講較短較好食，下鍋毋免折\n[Verse]\n我的長麵線，擱掛佇棚仔頂\n日頭曝甲，無人問\n我共阮某講：「你的手，放長一寸」\n伊講：「你的錢，放短一寸」\n[Pre-Chorus]\n伊的手短短，伊的手短短\n排隊的人，閣愈來愈濟\n[Chorus]\n手尺麵線，一把賣二十\n伊的手短短，麵線嘛短短\n客人排隊，專買伊彼把\n我的長麵線，賣無去一半\n[Verse]\n我就學伊，縮手拉麵線\n結果拉甲，一把一把歪\n阮某笑講：「你的手，袂曉短」\n[Bridge]\n喔喔喔，手尺麵線\n長長短短，攏是阮兜的\n[Chorus]\n手尺麵線，一把賣二十\n兩雙手拉，一長閣一短\n客人排隊，長短攏有買\n長的送壽，短的食快\n[Outro]\n手尺麵線，長長短短\n阮某的手，我愈來愈愛",
